)ATTR DEFAULT(@}_)
 @ TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE)
 } TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN)
 { TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(TURQ)
 _ TYPE(INPUT)  INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(RED)    CAPS(ON) JUST(LEFT)
 ! TYPE(OUTPUT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) CAPS(OFF) JUST(LEFT)
)BODY
@HELP: Output Queue Panel                       !ISFHMSG                      }
@COMMAND INPUT ===>_ISFHCMD                                                   }
}
}  The Output Queue panel (O) lists the jobs that have ended and have
}  output waiting to be printed, that is output not held. The oldest
}  comes first, by the time the job ended. The title line shows the
}  classes and forms you asked for and the lines of all the rows.
}
}  You see your own jobs, and the jobs of others as far as RAKF lets you
}  read them (topic 13 of the contents). PREFIX and DEST limit the list.
}
}  Action characters:
{   ?  }Show the job's data sets (Job Data Set panel).
{   S  }Browse the job's output (Output Data Set panel).
}  Others are not on this panel yet: ACTION NOT AVAILABLE YET. DEST can
}  be overtyped: the job's output goes there ($R). The other fields only
}  show, as JES2 here has no command to change them.
}
}  Type the number of a topic, or press Enter to see them in order.
@     1 }The O command: classes and forms
@     2 }The fields of the panel
@     3 }Commands on the list panels
}
}  Enter: topic 1   PF7: contents   PF10: back   PF3: back to SDSF
)PROC
  &ISFHPFK = .PFKEY
  &ZSEL = TRANS(&ISFHCMD
                 1,ISFHOQC
                 2,ISFHOQF
                 3,ISFHLSM
                *,'?')
  &ZCONT = ISFHOQC
  &ZUP = ISFHTOC
)END
